window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-8a5e375641422a4d"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"refresh-a-strategic-account-plan\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">更新战略客户账户计划</h1> <p>将近期账户动态整理成最新的交易策略资料包。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供账户与商机记录、通话、讨论串、邮件、使用情况说明、产品需求、旧计划和公司背景，然后请它更新利益相关方关系图、需求探索缺口、风险、价值假设、异议、证明材料和后续行动。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>计划过时或有多位活跃利益相关方的战略客户。</li> <li>需要在一份资料中整理需求探索缺口、异议、风险和证明材料的交易团队。</li> <li>希望下一步行动能够基于近期客户信号的账户审查。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>检查账户和商机记录、活动、使用情况信号及信息缺口。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读旧账户计划、客户文档、证明材料和公司背景。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>查看账户讨论串、利益相关方背景和未解决风险。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail（需联网）</a></td> <td>在本次范围包含相关邮件时，阅读近期客户或内部邮件背景。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>更新账户计划</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请更新 [account] 的战略账户计划。\n\n请使用我提供的 CRM 账户和商机记录或导出文件、近期通话记录、账户讨论串、邮件背景、客户文档、使用情况说明、旧账户计划、产品需求和相关公司背景。\n\n请制作一份交易策略资料包，包括：\n- 利益相关方关系图\n- 需求探索缺口\n- 风险和异议\n- 价值假设\n- 证明材料\n- 下一步最佳行动\n\n标记假设、过时信息，以及需要账户负责人或经理确认的内容。不要更新 CRM 记录，也不要联系客户。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-sales-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：销售团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/prioritize-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">为账户排定优先级（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"refresh-from-recent-customer-signals\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">根据近期客户信号更新计划</h2> <p>账户计划应反映客户近期的表态、行动和优先事项。向 ChatGPT 提供旧计划、账户和商机数据、近期通话、讨论串、邮件、使用情况说明、产品需求和获准使用的公司背景。</p> <ol> <li>说明账户、计划时间跨度、商机和团队受众。</li> <li>附上旧计划，以及近期账户、客户、产品和使用情况背景。</li> <li>请 ChatGPT 找出过时信息、需求探索缺口、利益相关方变化和未解决风险。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，审阅价值假设、异议、证明材料和下一步行动。</li> <li>更新 CRM 或分享面向客户的内容前，先与账户负责人确认计划。</li> </ol> <p>把客户证据与内部假设分开。标明哪些证明材料已获准用于客户沟通，并避免把内部风险写进面向客户的草稿。</p> <p><a id=\"make-the-plan-actionable\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">让计划可执行</h2> <p>请 ChatGPT 把后续行动与证据及负责人对应起来，避免计划沦为静态摘要。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn this account plan into a 30-day action map.\n\nFor each action, include:\n\n- customer or internal owner\n- source signal that justifies it\n- desired outcome\n- dependency or risk\n- suggested date\n- evidence that will show progress\n\nFlag actions that need AE or manager approval. Do not update CRM records or contact the customer.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请将这份客户计划整理成一份 30 天行动图。\n\n对于每项行动，包括：\n\n- 客户方或内部负责人\n- 支持采取该行动的来源信号\n- 期望结果\n- 依赖或风险\n- 建议日期\n- 能够证明进展的证据\n\n标出需要客户经理（AE）或经理批准的行动。不要更新 CRM 记录，也不要联系客户。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"refresh-a-strategic-account-plan\">Refresh a strategic account plan</h1> <p>Turn recent account activity into a current deal strategy pack.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT account and opportunity records, calls, threads, emails, usage notes, product needs, prior plans, and company context, then ask it to refresh the stakeholder map, discovery gaps, risks, value hypothesis, objections, proof points, and next actions.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Strategic accounts with stale plans or several active stakeholders.</li> <li>Deal teams that need discovery gaps, objections, risks, and proof points in one pack.</li> <li>Account reviews where next actions should be grounded in recent customer signals.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Inspect account and opportunity records, activity, usage signals, and gaps.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read prior account plans, customer docs, proof points, and company context.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Review account threads, stakeholder context, and open risks.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/gmail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">gmail (online)</a></td> <td>Read recent customer or internal email context when it is in scope.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Refresh the account plan</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>high</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Refresh the strategic account plan for [account].\n\nUse CRM account and opportunity records or exports, recent call transcripts, account threads, email context, customer docs, usage notes, prior account plans, product needs, and relevant company context I provide.\n\nCreate a deal strategy pack with:\n- stakeholder map\n- discovery gaps\n- risks and objections\n- value hypothesis\n- proof points\n- next-best actions\n\nFlag assumptions, stale information, and anything that needs account-owner or manager confirmation. Do not update CRM records or contact the customer.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-sales-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Sales teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/prioritize-accounts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prioritize accounts (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"refresh-from-recent-customer-signals\">Refresh from recent customer signals</h2> <p>An account plan should reflect what the customer has said, done, and prioritized recently. Give ChatGPT the prior plan, account and opportunity data, recent calls, threads, emails, usage notes, product needs, and approved company context.</p> <ol> <li>Define the account, planning horizon, opportunity, and team audience.</li> <li>Attach the prior plan and the recent account, customer, product, and usage context.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to identify stale information, discovery gaps, stakeholder changes, and open risks.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and review the value hypothesis, objections, proof points, and next actions.</li> <li>Confirm the plan with the account owner before updating the CRM or sharing customer-facing content.</li> </ol> <p>Keep customer evidence separate from internal assumptions. Mark proof points that are approved for customer use and keep internal risks out of a customer-facing draft.</p> <h2 id=\"make-the-plan-actionable\">Make the plan actionable</h2> <p>Ask ChatGPT to map the next actions to evidence and owners so the plan does not become a static summary.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn this account plan into a 30-day action map.\n\nFor each action, include:\n\n- customer or internal owner\n- source signal that justifies it\n- desired outcome\n- dependency or risk\n- suggested date\n- evidence that will show progress\n\nFlag actions that need AE or manager approval. Do not update CRM records or contact the customer.\n</code></pre>"};
